---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Breadcrumbs from "../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro";
import DocsNav from "../../components/DocsNav.astro";
import ScreenshotFigure from "../../components/ScreenshotFigure.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Meeting Pulse troubleshooting"
  description="Troubleshoot Meeting Pulse permission, stale, offline, revoked, and unavailable viewer states without guessing what the signal means."
  canonicalPath="/docs/troubleshooting/"
>
  <div class="docs-layout">
    <DocsNav />
    <article class="docs-content">
      <Breadcrumbs items={[{ href: "/", label: "Home" }, { href: "/docs/", label: "Docs" }, { label: "Troubleshooting" }]} />
      <p class="eyebrow">Troubleshooting</p>
      <h1>Read the state before you fix the state.</h1>
      <p class="lede" style="margin-top: var(--space-xl)">
        Meeting Pulse uses explicit messages so a missing or stale signal does
        not look like permission to interrupt.
      </p>

      <h2>“Meeting status unavailable”</h2>
      <p>
        The viewer cannot trust a current state. Check that Station is running,
        the owner Mac is connected, and Accessibility permission is still
        granted.
      </p>

      <h2>“Not connected”</h2>
      <p>
        The viewer is not connected to the paired owner state. Reopen the
        private link and check the viewer entry in Station.
      </p>

      <h2>The state looks old</h2>
      <p>
        Meeting Pulse updates periodically rather than continuously. If the
        timestamp is stale, treat the state as unavailable and check Station.
      </p>

      <h2>The detector is not seeing a supported call</h2>
      <p>
        Confirm the app is supported by the current release and that the owner
        app has the required permission. Manual Busy or Available controls can
        cover a moment the detector cannot observe.
      </p>
      <ScreenshotFigure
        light="/images/product-screens/meeting-pulse-diagnostics-window-light.jpg"
        dark="/images/product-screens/meeting-pulse-diagnostics-window-dark.jpg"
        alt="Meeting Pulse diagnostics window"
        caption="Diagnostics help the owner see what Station can determine."
      />

      <div class="callout">
        <strong>Still stuck?</strong>
        <p>
          Share a focused bug report with the release version and the state
          you saw. Keep private viewer links and recovery information out of
          public issues.
        </p>
        <p><a class="link-arrow" href="/open-source/">Open support links</a></p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
